# Run directories (docs/RUNBOOK.md "Run directories in git"; scripts/check_run_evidence.py):
# every file under runs/ is tracked except the heavy artefacts (*.h5, *.joblib, *.pkl above,
# *.npz, *.parquet, tb/ below) and the experiment log folders, so every cited number links to
# a tracked run and git status stays clean.
runs/**/*.npz
runs/**/*.parquet
runs/**/tb/
runs/ablations/*/cells/
runs/ablations/*/logs/
runs/experiments/*/logs/
!runs/**/*.csv

# Claude Code: agent worktrees and machine-local settings (agents/, skills/ and settings.json are tracked)
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
